==Notes==

* This feat will only work on large-sized creatures or smaller.
* This feat is not available to [[player character]]s. Sap was given an impossible prerequisite (level 100 spellcaster), effectively removing it from the feats available to PCs. (Consequentially, it was removed as a prerequisite for ''stunning fist''.)

